[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40628295/a363127917b748d82b2cb91a9ad94d3b0de7a5cc.png[/img]

Hey crawlers,

The launch is just a week away and we hope you are just as excited as we are!

We're happy to announce our shiny demo update to help you gear up for launch.


[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40628295/f0b5fbf6d4a75553464d1f6017af689f04ef4ce2.png[/img]

[h3][b]Demo patch notes[/b][/h3]

[list]
[*] [b]Random Encounters:[/b] Crawlers can now search for Arcane Shrines in the Ancient Realms to discover what treasures they hold;
[*] [b]Sinful Weapons:[/b] Unique weapons now drop from enemies, allowing crawlers to mix up their main and offhand weapons;
[*] [b]Hidden Rooms:[/b] Arcane Shrines may lead crawlers into a hidden treasure or trap room;
[*] [b]New Areas to Explore:[/b] New areas have been added to the Ancient Realms;
[*] [b]Improved Drop Rates: [/b]Enchanting Glyphs and Cosmetics now have a higher chance to be dropped from chests and bosses;
[*] [b]Visual Clarity Improvements: [/b]EXP orbs have been removed from crawls and the camera has been reworked;
[*][b] Melee buff: [/b]Melee weapons have had their strike range and damage increased to make them viable in the endgame;
[*] [b]Area Requirements:[/b] Crawlers now need to defeat enemies to open the area door, not just spawn them;
[*][b] New Music: [/b]New music has been added throughout the Realms.
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40628295/f0b5fbf6d4a75553464d1f6017af689f04ef4ce2.png[/img]

Enjoy the update and we'll see you real soon! In the meantime, don't forget to join our Discord.

[url=https://discord.gg/EYSpzrEYEv][img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40628295/16c4c728e242e765572f8cbb61d4098a26f0bb10.png[/img][/url]

[img]https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/41285182/2fa1bafb9074ba9480fc690b2d482f6d73a3ef0b.png[/img]

Greetings crawlers! 

We are thrilled to announce the release date of Knight Crawlers, which will be available on Steam starting [b]May 4th, 9am PT! [/b]

[previewyoutube=0Mf8mWsWlt0;full][/previewyoutube]

Prepare to embark on an adventure with thrilling battles and endless customizations as you spawn foes to your heart’s content! 

[img]https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/41285182/958b647995e83e56305563781dbfea2e4d739bf1.png[/img]

[b]Expect to find the following features at launch! [/b]

- [b]PvP arenas[/b] putting your friends and foes to the challenge;
- [b]Enchantments[/b] empowering your crawler for their next run;
- [b]Companions and Cosmetics[/b] letting you crawl in style;
- [b]Random Encounters[/b] surprising you every step of the way;
- Powerful [b]Dominions[/b] helping you access incredible skills;
- And the almighty [b]Eldrasil[/b] granting you stat bonuses for battle.

[img]https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/41285182/91ace0104acf12c17c736bb3fab6c5e92d8ca8fa.gif[/img]

We’ve got more planned but expect to hear more details after launch!  If you’re not already, take this opportunity to share your thoughts and be the first to know about impending updates by joining our [url=https://discord.gg/4Q2Yyn5wUZ]Discord[/url] and following us on [url=https://twitter.com/crawlersgame?lang=en]Twitter[/url]. Thank you for your continued support and we look forward to seeing you in Knight Crawlers on [b]May 4th![/b]
